  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium high heat and brown the beef pieces on all sides.",
    "Transfer the browned beef to a slow cooker and add the chopped onion.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the slow cooker and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the Jamaican curry powder to the slow cooker and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes to the slow cooker.",
    "Add the dried oregano, salt, and black pepper to the slow cooker and stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the beef broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the stew for 8 hours or overnight.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
